    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "note": "Finds GTA creators on YouTube and Twitch through their official APIs, watches uploads, scheduled and live streams, ranks them and records what they say about clipping. Read-only: it never downloads footage and never grants permission; a person approves each creator with 'vicepulse creator-review'. Keys live in the worker's .env (YOUTUBE_DATA_API_KEY, TWITCH_CLIENT_ID, TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET); without them the steps report 'skipped'."
